## 12. Data Flow in the Dashboard

The dashboard generally follows this path:

1. UI loads the page.
2. Frontend calls API endpoints.
3. Backend computes or fetches data.
4. Results are displayed in cards, charts, and tables.
5. Users can trigger a new prediction or run a new test.

